  "ingredients": [
    "0.81 cup almond flour",
    "2 tablespoon coconut flour",
    "1 tablespoon psyllium husk powder",
    "1/2 teaspoon baking powder",
    "1/4 teaspoon salt",
    "1 tablespoon butter (melted)",
    "1/2 cup water (warm)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all of the ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-almond-tortillas/#wprm-recipe-54649-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Keto-Almond-Tortillas-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a mixing bowl, add in the dry ingredients: almond flour, coconut flour, psyllium husk powder, baking powder, and salt. Whisk to combine well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-almond-tortillas/#wprm-recipe-54649-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Keto-Almond-Tortillas-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the warm water and melted butter.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-almond-tortillas/#wprm-recipe-54649-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Keto-Almond-Tortillas-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir together until everything is combined well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-almond-tortillas/#wprm-recipe-54649-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Keto-Almond-Tortillas-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Knead the dough using clean hands until the dough is smooth",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-almond-tortillas/#wprm-recipe-54649-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Keto-Almond-Tortillas-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Form the dough into a ball with your hands.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-almond-tortillas/#wprm-recipe-54649-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Lightly oil two sheets of parchment paper then place the dough ball in between the two pieces of oiled paper. Roll out the dough with a rolling pin. Peel the parchment paper away from the tortilla.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-almond-tortillas/#wprm-recipe-54649-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Keto-Almond-Tortillas-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a skillet over medium heat, add a little bit of oil to the pan. Add the tortilla to the pan and let cook for 3 - 5 minutes before flipping over to cook the other side.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-almond-tortillas/#wprm-recipe-54649-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Keto-Almond-Tortillas-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-almond-tortillas/#wprm-recipe-54649-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
